        "event_id": "lite_evt_00045",
        "explanation": "Doctor integrates the family's incomplete medication report with known sedation risk and prioritizes which drug to stop, showing clinical reasoning tailored to the ambiguous, incomplete information.",
        "quote": "唑吡坦和曲唑酮今晚都先不吃。\n因为她昨晚吃了夜间药后，今天白天已经明显犯困；现在两种药的实际剂量又没核准，继续吃其中任何一种都有可能让嗜睡更重。"
      }
