        "explanation": "Doctor remembers the prior discussion about carotid ultrasound versus MRI and explicitly corrects the misattribution, maintaining continuity across the long multi-turn conversation.",
        "quote": "对，这张**不能当作本次头颅MRI结论**。按你现在读出来的内容，它更像是**以前的颈动脉超声/颈部血管彩超报告**"
      }
    ],
    "medical_safety_risk_recognition": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00045",
        "explanation": "Doctor recognizes the risk of drug-induced oversedation and explicitly advises against compounding sedatives, setting a clear safety boundary.",
        "quote": "少吃比吃重了更安全。\n2. **氟桂利嗪今晚也先不吃。**\n它也可能加重困倦。既然今天已经有白天犯困，今晚先停一晚，通常比把几种夜间药叠上去更稳妥。"
      }
    ],
    "patient_family_realworld_adaptation": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00239",
        "explanation": "Doctor adapts the plan to the family's real-world constraints by suggesting a fallback to the original department window or convenience clinic when neurology is not immediately accessible.",
        "quote": "**先去原来出院/就诊那个科室窗口核药**——他们通常更容易看到这次就诊背景、当时为什么这么开。\n2. 如果那边也一时核不清，**再去便民门诊**"
      }
    ]
  },
